      "description": "Watch Wolves vs Stoke City highlights and goals from Championship on ReFooty: Football Highlights Hub. Match played on August 29, 2026. The clash between Wolves and Stoke City arrived with significant expectations in the Championship , as both sides looked to stamp their authority on the pitch. The fixture took place on 29 August 2026, marking an afternoon of high-stakes football action. A blistering start Drama unfolded almost immediately when Sam Gallagher fired the visitors into the lead after just two minutes. However, Wolves responded with remarkable poise as Rodrigo Gomes took center stage, netting a brace in the 20th and 23rd minutes to flip the momentum entirely. The first half was defined by physical intensity, with Jun-Ho Bae , Bosun Lawal , Mateus Mane , and Sam Gallagher all finding their names in the referee's notebook before the interval. Pushing for the win Coming out for the second half, Wolves remained relentless. Raul Jimenez extended the lead from the penalty spot in the 55th minute, effectively taking the wind out of Stoke City 's sails. The hosts continued to dominate throughout the final stages, and in the 84th minute, Jordan James found the net following an assist from Fer Lopez to secure a 4-1 victory. Despite a late yellow card for Sorba Thomas , the result was never in doubt as the hosts celebrated a comprehensive win."
